{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7486","chapterId":"sa39b9f6a9825e3fb","language":"zh-CN","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7486-c750f0971915ee9c5477","text":"列车长快救救我呀——","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-a64447b0897d9f2f1f46","text":"[自动回复]驾驶列车中，有事请留言！","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-481d6cc9ec3b5c7b3ea5","text":"别想骗我","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-61b717e2db56c5289ddc","text":"我都看到你正在输入了…","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-2288c4e13a7debfed4b0","text":"可恶，露馅了！","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-5163ee56315da854a3da","text":"我还没上车呢！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-9c416b8a620096649016","text":"怎么要开走了？我还没上车啊！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-ce5bf93f66c2e7fb231e","text":"耶，骗到你了，[开拓者]乘客！","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-e2ee64d117174eaf4acb","text":"不开玩笑了。找我有什么事吗，[开拓者]乘客？","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-6f8dfd6dab137c317c98","text":"其实，我有个朋友…","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-96ea2690eb7770f9bea1","text":"哦，你想要带朋友上车吗？","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-df5e5480701e8d3d5906","text":"那你说说看，这是位怎么样的朋友？","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-634a3e56395a6462aaa7","text":"你先组织好语言再说，帕姆需要慎重考虑！","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-e6d3fdf186806ac999bf","text":"她心思缜密…","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-c5b9ae5a0b78651ef143","text":"她是一位心思缜密的天才机械师","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-763dd84baa8b9cb6df5b","text":"哦！那么姬子小姐一定会表示欢迎！","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-e40c2726db3f861a606e","text":"她性格洒脱…","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-4a51b2949ad5d49e1b5d","text":"摇滚明星？可以给帕姆带张唱片吗？","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-2ffe3c85a1b281e1314d","text":"那就算了！其实帕姆也只是随便问问！","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-b15c1f6d13c964ac6157","text":"总之，帕姆觉得没问题！但是——","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-527f07bb66da9f12f165","text":"不许进引擎室！","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-c706e2bb6c30cbddb468","text":"不许搞破坏！","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-d0d19d452e26ddfbaea1","text":"能做到吗？","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-127a6b12ce0827716e60","text":"我尽量说服她…","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-c46e984ad93c6038756f","text":"我尽量说服她…","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-e0bdb87c147b13e829f3","text":"她估计控制不住","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-15f92f98a4afb5ab4d54","text":"她估计控制不住","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-5907800c3658be9b8964","text":"反正，这些事情不许！能做到，帕姆就没意见！","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-2037cddb2ca83b67d8f3","text":"明白，谢谢列车长","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-457bca298049be329a42","text":"明白，谢谢列车长","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-39cdf406d1ed206c26d2","text":"好！列车长最棒啦——","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-781085fe126d9a00e412","text":"好！列车长最棒啦——","speaker":""}]}
